<h1>Migration (Websites, Apps, Email, Files)</h1>
<p class="subhead">Minimize downtime with staged cutovers and a tested rollback.</p>
<div class="cards">
  <article class="card">
    <h3>Typical website move</h3>
    <ul class='bullets'><li>Export site (files + DB), freeze edits</li><li>Stand up target (EC2, Lightsail, or ECS/EKS)</li><li>Import data; validate behind a temporary hostname</li><li>Switch DNS TTL to low (300s), then cut over</li><li>Monitor logs, errors, and performance; roll back if needed</li></ul>
  </article>
  <article class="card">
    <h3>Email & files</h3>
    <ul class='bullets'><li>Inventory mailboxes and aliases</li><li>Migrate IMAP with sync; verify SPF/DKIM/DMARC</li><li>Move files into S3 + lifecycle policies or EFS/FSx as needed</li></ul>
  </article>
</div>

